366
11:09.720 --> 11:10.060
Okay.

367
11:10.840 --> 11:11.220
Got it.

368
11:35.480 --> 11:35.980
Hello.

369
11:36.320 --> 11:36.820
Ye.

370
11:37.080 --> 11:37.980
That's great.

371
11:38.150 --> 11:39.490
Amazing, really.

372
11:39.960 --> 11:41.100
When I saw the news yesterday,

373
11:41.150 --> 11:41.460
I knew

374
11:41.480 --> 11:42.730
