381
11:51.360 --> 11:53.100
What are you talking about? I don't get it.

382
11:53.240 --> 11:55.180
I'm talking about All Buy.

383
11:55.390 --> 11:56.340
That was wise.

384
11:56.510 --> 11:57.730
You did the right thing sending your little girlfriend

385
11:57.750 --> 11:58.580
out there.

386
11:58.750 --> 12:01.180
She's articulate and pretty.

387
12:01.320 --> 12:01.980
The craziest part is

388
12:02.150 --> 12:02.700
she thought

389
12:02.720 --> 12:03.610
of using a livestream

390
12:03.630 --> 12:04.770
for crisis PR.

391
12:05.120 --> 12:05.610
Right?

392
12:06.870 --> 12:08.530
By the way, how come

393
12:08.550 --> 12:09.340
her title

394
12:09.670 --> 12:10.530
is project lead?

395
12:10.600 --> 12:11.530
Weren't you the lead before?

396
12:12.320 --> 12:12.770
Livestream?

397
12:13.840 --> 12:14.130
Livestream.

398
12:14.630 --> 12:15.180
You didn't know?

399
12:23.000 --> 12:23.700
The project lead

400
12:23.750 --> 12:24.980
has always been me,

401
12:25.480 --> 12:26.060
Xu Chi.

402
12:30.150 --> 12:30.650
Exactly.

403
12:30.840 --> 12:32.420
The "All" in the All-He Digital Adaptation Fund

404
12:32.480 --> 12:33.980
