417
13:23.910 --> 13:24.980
And stay off the work group chats.

418
13:25.670 --> 13:26.300
Wait for me to come back.

419
13:27.480 --> 13:28.770
Xinzhi, trust me.

420
13:29.080 --> 13:29.770
