445
15:05.960 --> 15:07.180
So romantic!

446
15:23.390 --> 15:23.700
Hi.

447
15:23.870 --> 15:24.730
Can you wrap this up for me?

448
15:25.600 --> 15:26.340
Sorry.

449
15:26.440 --> 15:27.650
Our Ecuadorian roses

450
15:27.750 --> 15:28.530
