452
15:30.120 --> 15:31.220
Really, this gentleman right here.

453
15:31.440 --> 15:32.460
We're wrapping them now.

454
15:38.120 --> 15:38.890
Mr. Shen?

455
15:40.440 --> 15:41.060
You're

456
15:41.510 --> 15:42.650
Bu Tianna's boyfriend, Zhao Heng,

457
15:42.720 --> 15:43.060
