458
15:43.240 --> 15:43.700
Yeah, yeah.

459
15:43.840 --> 15:44.490
Hello.

460
15:44.600 --> 15:44.890
Mr. Shen.

461
15:46.270 --> 15:46.890
Back from the trip?

462
15:47.270 --> 15:47.580
Yeah.

463
15:47.630 --> 15:48.490
Getting flowers for Bu Tianna?

464
15:50.320 --> 15:50.850
Let me tell you,

465
15:51.440 --> 15:52.610
that girl

466
15:52.750 --> 15:53.650
