469
15:57.080 --> 15:57.530
Thanks!

470
15:58.150 --> 15:58.580
No problem.

471
16:00.510 --> 16:00.980
So shiny.

472
16:02.270 --> 16:02.580
Hey,

473
16:03.200 --> 16:04.980
