478
16:13.600 --> 16:14.890
But I went to the store in a hurry.

479
16:15.120 --> 16:15.890
They didn't have it in stock.

480
16:18.150 --> 16:18.580
Hurry?

481
16:19.200 --> 16:20.850
It's not even a special day.

482
16:21.080 --> 16:22.010
Why did you suddenly think

483
16:22.080 --> 16:23.060
of proposing to Lin?

484
16:26.150 --> 16:27.060
I...

485
16:27.600 --> 16:28.300
I guess I'm going

486
16:28.360 --> 16:29.460
