492
16:36.720 --> 16:37.610
Are you hoping to

493
16:38.120 --> 16:38.890
use this proposal

494
16:39.000 --> 16:40.220
to apologize to her?

495
16:40.790 --> 16:41.180
Yeah.

496
16:43.030 --> 16:44.010
From what I know about Lin,

497
16:44.120 --> 16:44.980
with her personality,

498
16:45.080 --> 16:46.100
if you pull something like that

499
16:46.150 --> 16:46.820
in public,

500
16:46.870 --> 16:48.060
you two are

501
16:48.720 --> 16:49.220
