509
16:59.320 --> 17:00.890
Plus, a total cop-out.

510
17:07.920 --> 17:09.460
Xinzhi, I'm back.

511
17:10.400 --> 17:11.290
Are you awake?

512
18:02.440 --> 18:02.940
Du.

513
18:03.400 --> 18:04.220
Do you know where Xinzhi is?

514
18:04.310 --> 18:05.290
I'm worried something happened to him.

515
18:11.310 --> 18:11.810
Chi,

516
18:12.550 --> 18:12.900
by the time

517
18:12.920 --> 18:13.860
you see this video...

518
18:16.030 --> 18:16.980
I might already be gone.

519
18:18.270 --> 18:18.810
Don't worry.

520
18:19.550 --> 18:20.180
I'm not mad that you

521
18:20.200 --> 18:21.620
