528
18:32.200 --> 18:33.050
Our team

529
18:33.960 --> 18:35.290
has never had a consultant surnamed Ye.

530
18:36.030 --> 18:37.980
The project lead has always been me, Xu Chi.

531
18:39.440 --> 18:40.220
But today,

532
18:41.680 --> 18:43.050
when I saw all those reports

533
18:43.070 --> 18:44.180
