534
18:45.750 --> 18:47.730
I had these really mixed, subtle feelings.

535
18:50.900 --> 18:55.580
♪Hey, that necklace♪

536
18:56.180 --> 18:57.800
♪I'm still wearing it close to my heart♪

537
18:57.880 --> 18:59.090
When I lost it,

538
18:59.880 --> 19:01.220
you came up with a better plan.

539
19:02.000 --> 19:02.900
You've become

540
19:02.920 --> 19:04.010
an outstanding consultant.

541
19:05.680 --> 19:06.220
Maybe

542
19:07.200 --> 19:08.090
even better than me.

543
19:09.720 --> 19:10.570
To be frank,

544
19:11.480 --> 19:12.660
I'm happy for you,

545
19:13.750 --> 19:14.420
but I also feel

546
19:15.880 --> 19:17.090
