554
19:43.860 --> 19:47.020
♪Even sorrow grew quiet♪

555
19:48.480 --> 19:49.730
I asked Mr. Kai for a long leave.

556
19:49.740 --> 19:51.680
♪Leaving only a role that smiles while it cries♪

557
19:51.750 --> 19:52.250
Chi.

558
19:54.160 --> 19:55.090
Give me some time.

559
19:55.100 --> 19:56.900
♪May your blessings be worth it♪

560
19:56.920 --> 19:57.900
I need to figure out

561
19:59.000 --> 20:00.290
if I'm still cut out to be

562
20:00.310 --> 20:01.180
a consultant.

563
20:03.920 --> 20:04.810
And think about

564
20:05.640 --> 20:06.250
how we should be

565
20:07.200 --> 20:08.290
with each other going forward.

566
20:09.240 --> 20:10.050
Maybe one day,

567
20:12.350 --> 20:13.460
I'll find the answer.

568
20:19.000 --> 20:20.620
Do you have to collect all of these?

569
20:21.750 --> 20:22.490
The world

570
20:22.680 --> 20:24.050
is made of

571
20:24.070 --> 20:24.620
108 elements.

572
20:26.070 --> 20:27.220
When I was a kid, I was naive.

573
20:28.000 --> 20:28.980
I thought if I collected them all,

574
20:29.000 --> 20:30.220
I'd have the whole world.

575
20:31.720 --> 20:32.660
Later, I learned

576
20:33.310 --> 20:34.460
