577
20:35.400 --> 20:35.940
I'd never be able to

578
20:35.960 --> 20:37.010
collect them all in my lifetime.

579
20:38.750 --> 20:39.250
Can I

580
20:41.110 --> 20:42.220
share my world

581
20:43.000 --> 20:43.810
