585
20:57.420 --> 20:58.940
♪And I was left feeling uneasy♪

586
20:58.940 --> 21:05.020
♪Only the sound of rain was left to touch me♪

587
21:05.860 --> 21:08.980
♪Even sorrow grew quiet♪

588
21:09.060 --> 21:14.220
♪Leaving only a role that smiles while it cries♪

589
21:14.260 --> 21:18.780
♪May your blessings be worth it♪

590
21:19.260 --> 21:22.620
♪Suddenly, the whole world fell silent♪

591
21:22.700 --> 21:27.540
♪Leaving only a role that smiles while it cries♪

592
21:27.700 --> 21:32.580
♪May your blessings be worth it♪

593
21:43.240 --> 21:43.940
You're back.

594
21:44.000 --> 21:44.980
I already told you not to come again.

595
21:45.480 --> 21:45.860
Just leave.

596
21:47.110 --> 21:48.290
No, let me explain...

597
21:48.480 --> 21:48.900
Wait.

598
21:50.880 --> 21:51.530
What happened to your neck?

599
21:56.680 --> 21:57.530
It's its blood.

600
22:01.510 --> 22:03.380
I made you an old hen soup.

601
22:03.750 --> 22:05.090
I came to apologize.

602
22:05.350 --> 22:05.860
I picked

603
22:05.880 --> 22:06.900
