608
22:10.720 --> 22:12.490
Wait, what is this game you're playing?

609
22:12.680 --> 22:13.980
Trying to make an example of the chicken?

610
22:15.240 --> 22:16.460
That... that's not what I meant.

611
22:17.510 --> 22:19.180
I... I'm not warning you.

612
22:19.310 --> 22:19.570
I mean,

613
22:19.720 --> 22:21.140
if anything, I should be warned.

614
22:21.550 --> 22:22.660
No, that's not the point.

615
22:23.720 --> 22:24.860
The point is I made

616
22:24.880 --> 22:26.220
