620
22:30.270 --> 22:30.810
It's good for...

621
22:30.830 --> 22:31.570
Stop your nonsense.

622
22:31.590 --> 22:32.180
Just... just go.

623
22:32.200 --> 22:32.860
Leave.

624
22:33.000 --> 22:33.860
No, let me expla...

625
22:33.920 --> 22:35.010
Just go!

626
22:35.070 --> 22:36.490
I... I... I really came to...

627
22:36.640 --> 22:38.180
No, just let me explain.

628
22:38.200 --> 22:38.620
Go!

629
22:44.590 --> 22:45.180
What's this?

630
22:48.350 --> 22:49.010
Nothing.

631
22:49.240 --> 22:49.980
What are you trying to do?

632
22:50.070 --> 22:50.940
I'm not trying to do anything.

633
22:51.200 --> 22:51.620
Shen Jin.

634
22:51.680 --> 22:52.010
Here!

635
22:52.720 --> 22:52.940
Leave.

636
22:52.960 --> 22:53.250
Got it.

637
23:03.070 --> 23:04.380
You won't even take the soup.

638
23:05.070 --> 23:05.900
Guess I'll have to

639
23:05.960 --> 23:07.700
