640
23:13.200 --> 23:14.380
3.334 Carats.

641
23:14.400 --> 23:15.250
Means three lifetimes of love.

642
23:15.310 --> 23:16.220
That's how they do it in dramas.

643
23:16.350 --> 23:17.530
If you don't mind, just take it.

644
23:28.070 --> 23:29.050
You won't drink the soup?

645
23:29.160 --> 23:29.980
And you won't take the ring?

646
23:30.270 --> 23:31.140
You gotta pick one.

647
23:37.720 --> 23:38.810
- Take the ring. - Take the ring.

648
23:45.400 --> 23:46.570
Get up now.

649
23:46.750 --> 23:47.220
Get in here.

650
23:48.830 --> 23:49.330
Get in.

651
23:50.790 --> 23:51.770
So embarrassing.

652
23:53.270 --> 23:54.220
How can I ever show my face again?

653
23:54.920 --> 23:55.290
Hey,

654
23:55.830 --> 23:57.220
