655
23:58.270 --> 23:59.420
You still haven't made your choice.

656
23:59.510 --> 24:01.180
Why are you on your knees again? Get up...

657
24:01.200 --> 24:02.140
Just hear me out first!

658
24:02.160 --> 24:03.050
Let me finish.

659
24:12.920 --> 24:14.010
I really thought about everything

660
24:14.070 --> 24:14.900
I did wrong.

661
24:15.590 --> 24:16.730
I need to tell you now.

662
24:17.350 --> 24:17.770
First,

663
24:19.030 --> 24:19.620
I run my mouth.

664
24:21.270 --> 24:21.700
I shouldn't have been

665
24:21.750 --> 24:22.940
putting down your job all the time.

666
24:24.200 --> 24:24.570
Second,

667
24:25.160 --> 24:26.250
I shouldn't have dragged you

668
24:26.310 --> 24:27.770
to activities you're not into.

669
24:28.640 --> 24:29.770
But I just wanted to

670
24:29.880 --> 24:31.180
help you unwind.

671
24:35.160 --> 24:35.570
Third,

672
24:36.960 --> 24:37.770
I shouldn't have disrespected

673
24:37.880 --> 24:38.530
