677
24:44.030 --> 24:44.380
Yeah.

678
24:44.590 --> 24:45.700
None of this matters now.

679
24:45.750 --> 24:46.900
It's all my fault. I...

680
24:48.680 --> 24:49.380
And I shouldn't have

681
24:50.680 --> 24:51.380
made you feel like

682
24:52.000 --> 24:52.860
I had no plan

683
24:52.920 --> 24:53.660
for our future.

684
24:55.000 --> 24:55.490
The truth is,

685
24:55.550 --> 24:56.620
I do have a plan.

686
24:57.350 --> 24:58.940
But you just got divorced.

687
24:59.640 --> 25:00.860
I'm afraid you have baggage when it comes to

688
25:00.880 --> 25:01.530
