689
25:02.920 --> 25:03.980
I've actually thought through everything

690
25:04.070 --> 25:05.250
for our future!

691
25:10.160 --> 25:10.490
Never mind.

692
25:10.550 --> 25:11.290
I don't even know why I'm

693
25:11.310 --> 25:12.380
telling you all this now.

694
25:13.030 --> 25:14.140
I actually came here today

695
25:14.200 --> 25:14.700
to make you...

696
25:15.440 --> 25:16.460
Just... just pick one.

697
25:16.680 --> 25:17.530
I'm begging you.

698
25:34.270 --> 25:35.620
Adults don't make choices.

699
25:36.880 --> 25:37.810
Can't I just pick both?

700
25:38.000 --> 25:39.380
No! You can only pick one...

701
25:49.550 --> 25:50.460
You're picking both?

702
26:22.880 --> 26:24.050
Can you make it three?

703
26:24.590 --> 26:25.250
What do you mean?

704
26:27.640 --> 26:28.460
Don't forget about me.

705
27:02.340 --> 27:06.340
[Lushui Lake Digital Economy Annual Conference]

706
27:21.830 --> 27:23.860
This is on me. I let him down.

707
27:25.160 --> 27:25.860
I knew

708
27:25.880 --> 27:27.420
all he wanted was to apologize to Mr. Liu.

709
27:28.440 --> 27:29.730
But the second Mr. Kai said

710
27:30.200 --> 27:31.770
another partner would replace him,

711
27:34.030 --> 27:34.770
I wavered.

712
27:36.550 --> 27:38.050
Because my biggest fear

713
27:39.960 --> 27:41.050
is being replaced.

714
27:44.240 --> 27:45.140
All I thought about

715
27:45.240 --> 27:46.220
was solving the All Buy mess

716
27:46.270 --> 27:47.570
in the safest way.

717
27:47.830 --> 27:48.290
But I never

718
27:48.310 --> 27:49.530
looked at it from his side.

719
27:50.270 --> 27:51.050
So

720
27:52.200 --> 27:53.810
whether as his assistant, his subordinate,

721
27:53.880 --> 27:54.490
or

722
27:56.310 --> 27:57.010
his fiancée,

723
27:58.030 --> 27:58.900
I am

724
27:59.830 --> 28:00.940
a total traitor.

725
28:02.070 --> 28:03.420
So when he walked away disappointed,

726
28:03.440 --> 28:04.010
I...

727
28:05.240 --> 28:05.900
I've got nothing to say.

728
28:06.830 --> 28:07.250
I don't even

729
28:07.270 --> 28:07.980
feel like I have

730
28:08.000 --> 28:09.010
the right to go after him.

731
28:13.790 --> 28:14.860
It's not that serious.

732
28:15.270 --> 28:16.940
In the video, he just said

733
28:17.030 --> 28:18.140
he needed to clear his head.

734
28:18.440 --> 28:19.570
He'll be back soon.

735
28:20.960 --> 28:22.140
He won't come back for me.

736
28:25.880 --> 28:26.980
That video...

737
28:27.790 --> 28:29.460
He only gave me an out because he was worried

738
28:29.680 --> 28:30.770
about me and wanted to comfort me.

739
28:31.750 --> 28:33.140
Du later told me

740
28:33.590 --> 28:34.660
Xinzhi's dad

741
28:34.680 --> 28:35.940
used to be a quality inspector too.

742
28:36.960 --> 28:38.490
After getting laid off in the 1990s,

743
28:38.550 --> 28:39.660
he borrowed money to do business.

744
28:40.110 --> 28:40.860
Then

745
28:42.720 --> 28:43.900
he jumped off a rooftop

746
28:43.960 --> 28:44.700
in front of Xinzhi.

747
28:46.400 --> 28:47.220
So Xinzhi's scared of heights.

748
28:48.880 --> 28:49.980
Even so,

749
28:52.400 --> 28:53.220
he'd always stand up there

750
28:53.240 --> 28:54.700
with me just because I loved

751
28:55.960 --> 28:57.090
the view from the rooftop.

752
28:59.720 --> 29:01.420
But I never once thought

753
29:02.960 --> 29:03.530
about

754
29:03.550 --> 29:04.620
what was behind his fear.

755
29:13.720 --> 29:14.140
Okay.

756
29:15.350 --> 29:16.250
Look at it this way, Xu.

757
29:17.480 --> 29:18.180
You got promoted.

758
29:18.640 --> 29:19.620
You've got your own team.

759
29:19.790 --> 29:21.330
And the project's about to deliver.

760
29:21.790 --> 29:22.660
Isn't that great?

761
29:23.000 --> 29:23.700
Yeah.

762
29:23.790 --> 29:24.660
It's great.

763
29:25.070 --> 29:25.900
In a few years,

764
29:25.920 --> 29:27.140
you'll make partner.

765
29:27.270 --> 29:27.770
Look at me.

766
29:28.640 --> 29:30.180
I don't even know how long I'll be

767
29:30.240 --> 29:30.940
stuck as director

768
29:30.960 --> 29:31.660
on this new project.

769
29:32.310 --> 29:33.330
Don't stress.

770
29:33.920 --> 29:34.530
Did you know?

771
29:34.790 --> 29:35.530
Her dad's actually

772
29:35.680 --> 29:37.220
teaching her how to

773
29:37.240 --> 29:37.940
run the company now.

774
29:38.310 --> 29:39.010
In two years,

775
29:39.640 --> 29:41.730
she'll be running the new energy subsidiary on her own.

776
29:42.960 --> 29:44.010
So your problems are all solved.

777
29:45.070 --> 29:46.180
The biggest problem now is me.

778
29:47.030 --> 29:48.330
I wanna get into real business.

779
29:49.440 --> 29:51.220
Master Xu, you know everyone.

780
29:51.510 --> 29:52.700
Help me get a referral, please.

781
29:54.480 --> 29:57.090
Sure. I'll refer you right now.

782
29:58.240 --> 29:58.770
Ms. Bu,

783
30:00.160 --> 30:01.330
what do you think of this guy?

784
30:06.750 --> 30:09.290
Ms. Bu, what do you think of me?

785
30:09.880 --> 30:10.730
What do you want?

786
30:13.550 --> 30:15.460
I wouldn't dare want anything.

787
30:46.310 --> 30:47.010
I'm fine.

788
30:47.480 --> 30:48.140
It's okay.

789
31:18.060 --> 31:22.500
[Courtyard No. 92, Yong'an Road]

790
31:22.510 --> 31:22.860
Leaving?

791
31:25.070 --> 31:26.530
Hua, you're heading out? Take care.

792
31:35.440 --> 31:35.940
Done.

793
31:36.960 --> 31:39.050
Done. Just fifteen minutes.

794
31:39.160 --> 31:39.860
You gotta be out by then.

795
31:39.920 --> 31:40.700
Great.

796
31:41.400 --> 31:42.530
I couldn't get the place for you.

797
31:42.640 --> 31:43.330
But I had to make good

798
31:43.350 --> 31:44.380
on that big bonus you gave me.

799
31:44.960 --> 31:46.180
I heard from the city

800
31:46.200 --> 31:47.530
that after reinforcing the houses affected

801
31:47.550 --> 31:48.090
by the collapse,

802
31:48.350 --> 31:49.010
they're letting one person per household

803
31:49.030 --> 31:49.810
go in during designated times

804
31:49.830 --> 31:50.530
to grab essentials,

805
31:50.790 --> 31:51.730
so I signed you up for it.

806
31:52.070 --> 31:52.860
Thank you so much.

807
31:53.550 --> 31:54.290
I'll head in now.

808
31:56.880 --> 31:57.330
Hello.

809
31:57.720 --> 31:58.090
Hi.

810
31:59.880 --> 32:01.330
Okay. It's pretty dangerous in there.

811
32:01.440 --> 32:02.250
Quick in, quick out.

812
33:21.030 --> 33:22.250
Then let's buy this place.

813
33:24.590 --> 33:25.810
I don't have that kind of money.

814
33:26.310 --> 33:27.010
You've got me.

815
33:28.590 --> 33:29.660
Give me a chance

816
33:30.240 --> 33:31.980
to do what a boyfriend should do.

817
33:33.550 --> 33:34.180
Alright?

818
33:39.510 --> 33:39.980
Xu.

819
33:40.830 --> 33:41.290
Time to go.

820
33:42.070 --> 33:43.290
The staff outside are rushing us.

821
33:44.480 --> 33:44.900
Okay.

822
33:46.400 --> 33:46.940
Wait, Xu.

823
33:49.960 --> 33:51.330
How about you take this?

824
33:51.680 --> 33:52.810
Just as a keepsake.

825
33:53.590 --> 33:55.330
If this place really gets torn down next week,

826
33:55.680 --> 33:57.140
there'll be nothing left.

827
34:06.160 --> 34:07.250
Take a few photos.

828
34:07.830 --> 34:08.530
Hurry down.

829
34:22.280 --> 34:24.090
I used to think this apartment

830
34:24.110 --> 34:25.260
was worth giving everything for.

831
34:25.800 --> 34:26.650
But only now

832
34:26.670 --> 34:27.860
do I finally get it...

833
34:29.710 --> 34:30.740
I don't get anything at all.

834
35:07.230 --> 35:07.940
Xinzhi?

835
35:10.510 --> 35:11.740
It's really you!

836
35:12.840 --> 35:13.610
Ikkyu-san?

837
35:14.360 --> 35:15.460
What are you doing in Iraq?

838
35:15.840 --> 35:16.340
I

839
35:16.360 --> 35:17.610
even consulted you before.

840
35:17.630 --> 35:19.260
You forgot?

841
35:20.000 --> 35:21.820
The refinery I'm in charge of building

842
35:22.190 --> 35:23.610
is 200 kilometers that way.

843
35:24.070 --> 35:24.690
I'm on leave today.

844
35:24.710 --> 35:26.050
So I brought some colleagues out to look around.

845
35:26.670 --> 35:28.380
What about you? Here on business?

846
35:29.000 --> 35:30.420
I've got nothing going on lately.

847
35:30.440 --> 35:30.980
Just taking a break.

848
35:31.710 --> 35:32.300
A break?

849
35:33.280 --> 35:33.780
You're skipping

850
35:33.800 --> 35:35.690
the Blue Hole you've always wanted to see,

851
35:35.840 --> 35:37.460
and coming to this godforsaken desert?

852
35:38.510 --> 35:39.650
You look exactly like you did

853
35:40.070 --> 35:41.860
back when you found out

854
35:41.880 --> 35:42.530
your ex-wife

855
35:42.550 --> 35:43.690
was dead set

856
35:43.710 --> 35:44.260
on emigrating.

857
35:46.630 --> 35:47.300
Heartbroken again?

858
35:50.840 --> 35:51.420
I'm really fine.

859
35:52.590 --> 35:53.940
Just out here clearing my head.

860
35:54.760 --> 35:55.530
Liar.

861
35:56.000 --> 35:57.740
Didn't you used to brag to me

862
35:57.800 --> 35:59.420
on WeChat about your girlfriend?

863
36:00.230 --> 36:01.260
And now you're out here alone?

864
36:08.110 --> 36:09.490
I remember she said

865
36:09.840 --> 36:11.130
the Tower of Babel was the place

866
36:11.150 --> 36:11.980
she wanted to go most.

867
36:13.960 --> 36:14.740
So I came to see

868
36:15.880 --> 36:16.570
what's so magical

869
36:17.440 --> 36:18.420
about this place

870
36:19.360 --> 36:20.090
that it drew her in.

871
36:22.230 --> 36:22.900
Got your answer?

872
36:24.800 --> 36:25.210
No.

873
36:25.880 --> 36:27.460
But after some time alone,

874
36:29.760 --> 36:31.420
I think maybe

875
36:32.070 --> 36:33.090
my decision to leave

876
36:33.590 --> 36:34.490
was a bit impulsive.

877
36:37.110 --> 36:37.900
Honestly,

878
36:39.630 --> 36:40.460
I still haven't figured it out.

879
36:41.800 --> 36:42.530
Regret it?

880
36:43.150 --> 36:43.650
No.

881
36:44.190 --> 36:45.570
But I think you do.

882
36:47.480 --> 36:48.530
You used to smile a lot.

883
36:49.230 --> 36:50.740
But since you saw me just now,

884
36:50.760 --> 36:51.780
you've barely smiled.

885
36:56.280 --> 36:57.690
When I first got here,

886
36:58.000 --> 36:59.530
I read a travel guide.

887
36:59.800 --> 37:00.340
It told

888
37:00.360 --> 37:01.170
a story.

889
37:01.230 --> 37:02.780
It said in ancient times,

890
37:02.800 --> 37:04.740
people wanted to build

891
37:04.840 --> 37:06.010
a tower reaching for the heavens.

892
37:07.000 --> 37:08.090
But they didn't get

893
37:08.110 --> 37:09.300
God's permission first.

894
37:09.360 --> 37:10.420
So God got angry

895
37:10.550 --> 37:11.650
and cast a spell,

896
37:11.840 --> 37:12.740
so everyone

897
37:12.920 --> 37:14.010
spoke different languages.

898
37:14.510 --> 37:14.740
That way,

899
37:14.760 --> 37:15.820
they couldn't communicate.

900
37:16.710 --> 37:17.130
And of course,

901
37:17.320 --> 37:18.570
the tower never got built.

902
37:27.630 --> 37:28.130
Xinzhi.

903
37:28.960 --> 37:29.980
What I mean is,

904
37:31.230 --> 37:31.900
if you and she

905
37:31.920 --> 37:33.260
have problems,

906
37:33.590 --> 37:35.010
why can't you just talk it out?

907
37:35.960 --> 37:36.780
Aren't you speaking

908
37:37.480 --> 37:38.690
the same language?

909
38:05.480 --> 38:06.530
While I'm away this week,

910
38:06.630 --> 38:07.460
I'm leaving the mentoring

911
38:07.480 --> 38:08.260
to you.

912
38:08.880 --> 38:09.490
See if

913
38:09.760 --> 38:11.170
you can spot a few with real potential.

914
38:12.440 --> 38:13.920
[Tina]

915
38:18.550 --> 38:18.860
Hello?

916
38:19.630 --> 38:21.010
You just sent a WeChat message

917
38:21.110 --> 38:22.820
and took off without even calling.

918
38:23.280 --> 38:24.980
You've never even been outside Asia,

919
38:25.070 --> 38:26.740
and you're going straight to the Blue...?

920
38:27.000 --> 38:27.530
Blue Hole.

921
38:27.670 --> 38:28.570
Blue... Blue Hole.

922
38:30.190 --> 38:31.420
I finally got some time off.

923
38:31.630 --> 38:32.650
And I booked a local tour.

924
38:32.760 --> 38:33.420
It's not that scary.

925
38:34.510 --> 38:35.260
Chi, how about this?

926
38:35.280 --> 38:36.260
Let me recommend another place.

927
38:36.320 --> 38:37.650
The Maldives! Way less jet lag.

928
38:38.030 --> 38:38.820
But I only wanna go

929
38:38.840 --> 38:39.780
to the Blue Hole in Dahab.

930
38:40.550 --> 38:41.130
I wanna see

931
38:41.150 --> 38:42.010
how beautiful it is,

932
38:42.550 --> 38:44.010
so that he can't stop thinking about it.

933
38:47.760 --> 38:48.260
Okay, okay.

934
38:48.320 --> 38:49.610
Your flight's delayed anyway.

935
38:49.630 --> 38:51.130
Just wait for me at the café

936
38:51.230 --> 38:52.650
by Exit 12 on the arrivals level.

937
38:53.000 --> 38:54.010
Zhao Heng and I will be right there.

938
38:54.150 --> 38:55.210
We'll talk when we meet up.

939
38:55.280 --> 38:55.610
Alright?

940
39:12.050 --> 39:22.880
[Explore Dahab's Blue Miracle; Dive into the Deep Blue]

941
39:41.020 --> 39:44.220
♪I can forget you♪

942
39:46.820 --> 39:49.980
♪When the storm has finally passed♪

943
39:52.820 --> 39:58.500
♪When my heart no longer carries your trace♪

944
40:05.260 --> 40:08.420
♪I want to forget you♪

945
40:11.460 --> 40:14.820
♪The red light stops me at the crossroads♪

946
40:17.460 --> 40:23.140
♪Yet I still wish to linger in your eyes♪

947
40:27.500 --> 40:30.260
♪Back to the days gone by♪

948
40:30.980 --> 40:33.140
♪Nothing can replace♪

949
40:33.220 --> 40:35.780
♪The heartbeat you stirred within me♪

950
40:35.860 --> 40:39.700
♪It still has no expiration date♪

951
40:43.300 --> 40:45.180
♪But why♪

952
40:45.700 --> 40:48.540
♪Time has turned into ruins♪

953
40:49.020 --> 40:51.820
♪You left me standing here♪

954
40:52.020 --> 40:56.420
♪I am the ruins you left behind♪

955
41:13.020 --> 41:14.940
♪I look upon this unfamiliar face of mine♪

956
41:14.940 --> 41:15.490
- Sorry. - Sorry.

957
41:19.300 --> 41:22.740
♪Still carrying the expressions of you

958
41:25.180 --> 41:30.420
♪How could another name ever replace yours♪

959
41:35.180 --> 41:37.860
♪Back to the days gone by♪

960
41:38.580 --> 41:40.900
♪Nothing can replace it♪

961
41:41.100 --> 41:43.660
♪A butterfly's wings begin to flutter♪

962
41:43.740 --> 41:47.500
♪Where waves remain deep beneath the sea♪

963
41:50.980 --> 41:53.500
♪Nothing can replace it♪

964
41:53.580 --> 41:56.060
♪Time has turned to ruins♪

965
41:56.660 --> 41:59.420
♪I keep you deep within my heart♪

966
41:59.980 --> 42:05.660
♪Forever beautiful through all eternity♪

967
42:20.260 --> 42:25.180
[You Are Irreplaceable]

968
42:40.460 --> 42:45.340
♪Orange sky at dusk; the evening breeze is waiting♪

969
42:45.620 --> 42:50.500
♪The crowd at the crossing suddenly scatters♪

970
42:50.740 --> 42:59.060
♪This world moves too fast, yet you walk slowly toward me♪

971
43:01.380 --> 43:06.300
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

972
43:06.460 --> 43:11.380
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

973
43:11.420 --> 43:15.980
♪Last time you had something left unsaid, right?♪

974
43:16.220 --> 43:21.100
♪Why did you stop again?♪

975
43:21.700 --> 43:26.340
♪We keep moving like the stream, never resting♪

976
43:27.060 --> 43:31.420
♪Through the muddy fields, rushing toward the sea♪

977
43:31.460 --> 43:36.460
♪I know you'll be waiting there♪

978
43:36.780 --> 43:41.660
♪Together with me♪

979
43:42.420 --> 43:47.300
♪We're like the evening breeze tangling with the clouds♪

980
43:47.820 --> 43:52.380
♪Strolling among the clouds, waiting for the sky to clear♪

981
43:52.420 --> 43:56.980
♪You steal glances at me. You like me, right?♪

982
43:57.260 --> 44:02.140
♪Stop running away♪

983
44:23.260 --> 44:28.420
♪The sky slowly brightens, falling into our eyes♪

984
44:28.580 --> 44:33.420
♪The wind gradually stops, and finally it clears up♪

985
44:33.700 --> 44:38.740
♪The evening breeze brushes past your shoulder, and you turn your head♪

986
44:39.620 --> 44:44.740
♪You're irreplaceable♪

987
44:44.740 --> 44:45.740
kissasia.biz
